WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:05.000
You're on the job. Hands full. The phone rings.

2
00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:08.100
Most people won't leave a message.

3
00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:16.000
So we text them back, right away.

4
00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:26.000
They tell you what they need and pick a time. You get the booking.

5
00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:34.000
Never miss a job. Ask for your free audit.
